1
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:17,810
Come on, filter it out. Adjust the
gain. No, not that frequency band.

2
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:20,970
[ROOM] You've been working for six hours
straight. I recommend taking a break now.

3
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,500
I can't do this anymore.

4
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,420
I'm always taking up too much air.

5
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:46,240
You don't even listen to me anymore.

6
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:51,300
I'm trying, but you keep shutting down.

7
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:08,230
I've lost the frequency
and I can't start again.

8
00:01:18,210 --> 00:01:19,960
Look at my shoes.

9
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:26,060
My head feels like there's
too many open browser tabs.

10
00:01:39,670 --> 00:01:41,100
We did it.
